<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"Hello!? Is this the police!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and Shirozaki-san set off, and right after I saw them go, I called the police.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I had to ask for outside help while there was still a signal.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"How did it go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The first-response unit is moving out now and will reach Arata Station in 2 to 3 hours. 
{PAUSE ""}
Depending on the unit's judgment, they'll come with more people at dawn. 
{PAUSE ""}
They said they'd like us to come to Arata Station if we can. 
{PAUSE ""}
And they told me that once we get there, we absolutely must not move from that spot."<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right. Either way, let's head there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We should let <STYLE ID="2">Shirozaki-san</STYLE> and the others know too, shouldn't we?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right. Do you have </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s number?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah... come to think of it, I never got the chance to ask..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then I'll try calling </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">Now, I need to think about our plan from here.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">First, once we reach Shirozaki-san and the others, tell them we've asked for outside help and were told to stay where we are as much as possible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">After that, whether to search for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is for Shirozaki-san and the others to decide.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Once we're done talking, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and I head straight for Arata Station.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That's odd. He's not picking up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Not picking up...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Right now he must be moving while he checks </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s location. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">He set it to block incoming calls at times like that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> told me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If a call came in, they might lose track of where <STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE> and the others are. 
{PAUSE ""}
Should we go after them?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, let's keep heading for the station. If the two of them have gone off the mountain road, we'd be in trouble too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You're right. Let's do that."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">I got on the buggy with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um... how do you drive this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="4">Shirozaki-san</STYLE> twisted the grip like on a motorcycle, didn't he?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm, like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">And the buggy began to creep forward.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"At this rate, I think we'll get there in about 20 minutes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">All I'm doing is sitting here, but spending 20 whole minutes like this would be a waste.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I'll put my head to work as hard as I can.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Right, first, let me sort out everything up to now.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\死神整列.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">According to Shirozaki-san, the residents ran wild and attacked </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> met an unfortunate end, but I was rescued, like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That was thanks to a faction that opposed extreme action, like Shirozaki-san, and to </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s parents.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Without Shirozaki-san, I would probably still be shaking in that cave.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">What's more, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was said to be safe as well.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The reason they could state it for certain was that a bugging app had been planted in our phones.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I, along with </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, take refuge at Arata Station; Shirozaki-san and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> search for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Sorted out, that is where things stand.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Now, from here on is analysis mixed with guesses and hypotheses.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> has a danger-sense ability, and the one who tipped off the residents about it was almost certainly </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The basis for that: the conditions of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s danger sense were a lie.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In other words, he must have been sure that we, starting with </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, would soon be silenced, meaning dead.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Now, here's one question.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> lie and tip off the residents about </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">You could think it's because we were deducing the truth of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s death and that got in his way, but―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, the way he went about it is odd.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Going by the timeline, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> tipped off the residents while we were having our ghost-story talk, or while we were doing fireworks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At the time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> withdrew so as not to get dragged into our squabbling, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I see. So the real reason he withdrew was that he needed to get to the residents without anyone seeing him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even so, it's still odd.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">At that point, nobody had brought up the curse-killings or </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> at all yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Trying to kill us at that point would be far too hasty.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So it probably wasn't to silence us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Depending on how things went, it's even possible the attempt to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was something </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> never expected.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">In that case, he didn't lie because he knew we were going to die.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's the reverse.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">He lied because we were likely to survive.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If I hadn't heard from Shirozaki-san about the conditions of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s danger sense, I would have gone on misreading the conditions of the foresight.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Hmm. That's as far as I go on </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s actions and the residents' actions.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Next, the matter of the residents who had been killed.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\荒田住人死んでる.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Earlier, when I went through the settlement with Shirozaki-san, bodies wearing Noh masks and red robes were lying all over the place.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">It would seem the radicals and the moderates fell out among themselves, but...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Moderates or not, what they do is still extreme.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was probably what they clashed over: whether to kill her or not.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But is that really so?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I have all sorts of reasons for doubting it, but―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">One reason is that almost all of the residents were dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Killing a person with a blade or a blunt weapon takes a great deal of strength.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even with a nata or a mace like those, a person won't easily die unless you catch them off guard and strike again and again.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">So that looks like the result of powerful, one-sided attacks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What's more, the attackers haven't shown themselves at all.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Therefore, there are most likely only a few of them.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A small, elite team with enough fighting power to kill that many people with ease.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Are there really people with that kind of fighting power in this settlement?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Rather than a fight between factions, that was a few people taking on a crowd and killing them, with powerful attacks at that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, there was no sign of anyone who might be the killers.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Taking on that many people, they'd have taken a few hits, and above all, they'd be worn out.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">And yet they vanished right away, which means―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">! Stop!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
