{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The murders of these past 10 years, and today's slaughter of the residents.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Weren't they the work of someone who had stayed hidden all along?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For one thing, the idea that one of the residents is behind the curse-killings is as unnatural as it gets.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">After all, people have been killed for 10 whole years, and there's still no idea who the culprit is.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And tonight, through that abnormal situation, you could say it finally showed a </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="へんりん">glimpse</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> of itself.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That said, I don't know who it is.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But there definitely is someone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Someone pulling the strings on everything from behind the scenes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Most likely </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="そそのか">egged on</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> by that person into maneuvering the residents.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">But if so, there's a contradiction.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maneuvering the residents into killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> makes no sense.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">If the real culprit had attacked </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> personally, the risk would have been lower, and things would never have gotten this flashy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, help from outside is coming tomorrow morning.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Now that it's come to this, even the real culprit won't get off unscathed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Which means...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Something must have happened that even the real culprit didn't expect.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's why they had no choice but to act themselves and kill the residents.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What is it, then? The real culprit's goal...</STYLE><PG>
