<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, did you see </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> went looking for her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hmm, I don't know. If I'd found her, we'd be together."</STYLE>
