{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And yet </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was climbing onto the buggy too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So what was here was an aberration.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even so, I couldn't get a word out, couldn't take a step―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">and was about to just see the two of them off.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "1000" "1000" "WAIT"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">In the end, I stayed sitting where I had fallen and didn't move any further.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The two of them really did leave.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">It wasn't that being left behind had shocked me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was an aberration: for the first time, I could be sure of it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And yet―even though I knew, I hadn't been able to do anything.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A sense of helplessness had drained the strength from my legs.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Then, from the opposite direction to the buggy―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">from the settlement, I heard footsteps.</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah... haah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Niimura... Senpai</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="5">! You okay!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> started patting me all over.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Are you really okay? You're not hurt anywhere!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes... What about you, <STYLE ID="5">Senpai</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Haha, I ran so much I'm totally wiped out."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">The aberration earlier</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had been nothing like this: </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was drenched in sweat and gasping hard.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That's right. Normally, getting here would wear you out this much.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And yet </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">that aberration</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had shown no sweat and no shortness of breath.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I could be sure this </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was the real one, but at the same time it drove home all over again that seeing the two of them off had been a mistake.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... did you see </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I did..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> was wearing white, wasn't she!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"She was... But she and <STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE> went off together on the buggy..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Haah... haah... damn... too late...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sank down on the spot, just like me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Ahh, man... I'm at my limit... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Damn... my legs won't move..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Then, this time, several sets of footsteps from the direction of the settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and Shirozaki-san.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And riding on Shirozaki-san's back was </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">a girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> I had never seen before.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―I heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="てんまつ">the whole story</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was the source of everything, but unable to bear piling up any more evil deeds, she had apparently betrayed her comrades.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And just as I'd thought, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had apparently turned into an aberration called a divine messenger.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Ojisan</STYLE>, I'm sorry. I couldn't stop <STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There's no use saying that now. I'm going after </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">"Please wait! That's dangerous!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　If you go near </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> now...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But if things stay like this...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That's it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> must know about that drug, right? Can't we use it? I've got some, and so does </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"You must never use that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">If you do, their skillful talk will draw you in as a divine messenger in no time. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">And even with the drug, that is, Droga, I don't think a flesh-and-blood human can defeat a divine messenger."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Won't this gun work?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"It won't. Hitting her would be hard, and even if you did, she would surely regenerate right away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> is already dead, so killing her in the first place is..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Then bringing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> back is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"To be frank... it's hopeless..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Damn...! Not just </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"I said hopeless, but that doesn't mean there's no chance.</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Akane-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> has to be alive, or they'll have a problem."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean?"</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\絶対何か居る雰囲気のアレ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="15">"The Shigatsu Youka―in other words, the cherry tree here, the root of it all, wants four divine messengers. [TN: Written 'death-month bewitching flower'; it sounds like 'April 8'.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Living first and second generations, and dead first and second generations. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">The dead first and second generations are </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">, so those are already filled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">What's left is the living first and second generations. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Akane-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> has Droga too, so they'll surely take it and use it to make </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Akane-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> the living first generation."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean, generations?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Put simply, someone who used Droga is first generation, and someone covered in first-generation blood is second generation."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Hold on a minute.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That means they're short a living second generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was killed, so she's a dead second generation.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But then she'd overlap with </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">I see.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So that's how it is.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At last I could understand all those baffling actions.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">This is something I can say only because dead people moving is now a fact.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The beheading of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> 10 years ago was probably done by </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">He</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was the only person at the time who could act without anyone knowing he existed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That way he staged a baffling incident and spread distrust through the settlement.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Then he switched from the old people's suicides to murder, trying to empty the settlement as fast as he could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> became their puppet and probably did whatever </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> told him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Most likely, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> telling the residents about </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s precognition was on </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s orders.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had to stay alive.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">There must have been an exchange like this.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Everyone's probably getting into the ghost stories about now, so I can move too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, tell all the residents to take </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Take her alive...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"You know what divine messengers are for, don't you?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"I see, so you need a living second generation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"We dead can't exactly go walking around out in the open."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Got it."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"―And that's how it is. A </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">witch</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> has come to this settlement."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―So, at last, the one behind the curse-killings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Will peace finally come back to the settlement?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Be sure to take her alive. I'm counting on you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Well, then."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Alive, huh... Well, it's best if no blood is shed..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Hey, can you really catch a witch that easily?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―We don't know what powers she has. I think we should kill her on the spot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―I think so too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Heeey, heeey! Don't say scary stuff like that!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Ko-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said to take her alive!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I agree with Kaori-san. There's no need to go as far as killing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Kaori-san, Shirozaki. Take her alive, and the result's the same. We kill her either way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―That's right, we should kill her after all.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said he wants her taken alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Shirozaki, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't say why he wants her alive. It can't be anything important.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―That's right, that's right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―I'm for killing her right away too! We'll take revenge on everyone's enemy!</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">It's only a guess, but there was probably an exchange like that.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And then―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\死神\死神軍団武器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,000" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">The radicals among the residents really did try to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, and attacked her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But after we ran away―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "32" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"My, my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you messed it up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">―Why are you alive!?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"S-</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, it's not like that! I really was going to take her alive...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Never mind that. At this rate, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is going to die any minute. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">We have to hurry and have her reborn as a divine messenger."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみメッタざし.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2,人物3" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you don't want to die, do you? You want to live, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"So you can't even make a sound anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">But you don't want to die, do you? If you wish to live, you can live."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"That's it, that's it. Wish like that, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> can exist as a living second generation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\なつみ御使.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Whew..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"How do you feel?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Thanks to you, I feel great."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Good, good. Then, to start with. You know what to do, don't you?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">And so the residents in the settlement were </STYLE><STYLE ID="18" RUBY="せんめつ">wiped out</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> by the divine messengers.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\なつみ御使.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Now, next are the ones who ran, and the residents who chased them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, you go after </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, huh... Where would she be...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Well, as for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">, there's nothing for it but to search the hard way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s movements are unknown, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went looking for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> like this, and―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">And that brings us to now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But this girl </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> also seems to believe </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is dead.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Something doesn't add up.</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, <STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE>, got a minute?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE>, until a little while ago your senses were linked to <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Until when, exactly?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Until the residents attacked </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">I just couldn't bear to watch anymore, and at that moment..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So you didn't actually confirm whether <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> really died, did you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">　Well, that's true... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">You don't mean...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I think <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> was saved by the divine messengers right on the brink of death."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"I see..."</STYLE><PG>
"Even if <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> became a divine messenger, that doesn't mean she died, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　In that case, isn't there a way to save <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>―to turn her back to normal?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"A way to save her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah. Isn't there something...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> put her hand to her chin and fell deep into thought.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">From the look of her, it seemed there might be no ready method at all, but...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"It's not that there isn't one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Only, it's terribly unrealistic..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Tell me! Whatever it is."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\糸姫赤\糸姫赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="15">"We ask the one who is the core of the Shigatsu Youka."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The core?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yes."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\その女、闇より出る的なBGM.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"But that core... isn't it you, <STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"I was indeed the core. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">But as you can see, I have broken with the Shigatsu Youka. Now a certain person has become the core."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A certain person..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"The Shigatsu Youka is a fungus, and was never originally something with intelligence. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">I was the first to be taken in by the Shigatsu Youka, and I gave it human intelligence. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Since then it has taken in countless people, one after another, so the core no longer has to be me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">All that matters is that the Shigatsu Youka and the core are in agreement."</STYLE><PG>
"Who is it!? The core now!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"I'm sorry, I wasn't told that either."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I see. If </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had gradually come to refuse killing, they wouldn't want to give her that kind of information.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But put the other way around, the current core is a fiendish human who doesn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="19" RUBY="いと">shrink</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> from murder.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Who on earth is it...?</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, do you know when the person who became the core was taken in by the <STYLE ID="20">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yes, that I do know. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">I do not remember clearly, but I believe it was about 20 years ago..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The person taken in by the <STYLE ID="15">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> 20 years ago is the core. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Shirozaki-san</STYLE>, did anyone die around then?
{PAUSE ""}
　Someone a little off, the type who wouldn't refuse to kill?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"No, there shouldn't be anyone like that. Nobody who'd kill because they liked it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I figured..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"The one who is that core is called 'Abaddon' in a Western tongue."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Abaddon...?
{PAUSE ""}
　That means the king of the abyss, if I remember right."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So that... what do you call it, the Abaddon currently on duty, is that it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　We ask that one to release </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"That is the only way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">But how to persuade..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I understand. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Either way, let me meet that one right now. My </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">wife</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">daughter</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s lives are on the line."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Ojisan</STYLE>, I understand how you feel, but you mustn't rush. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE>'s account means the two of them shouldn't be killed. We need to gather more information properly first..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... Gathering information or not, if that's the only way..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\城崎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't really get it, but what about us right now?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If we run into </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Eiichiro-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, aren't we in danger?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Indeed, those two are the greatest threat. They must be searching for us even now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="15"> knows where we are, so it is only a matter of time before they come here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Then let me meet the one who's the core, quick! Where do I go!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"I expect that if I call out from right here, there will be a response..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Huh? You mean it'll suddenly appear right here...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"Yes. This whole area of Arata is her domain."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\良治正面バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Call her right now! This concerns my family!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Very well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">Everyone, are you prepared? We will be calling the source of everything here. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">If the negotiations break down, all of us..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There's no time, hurry. If things stay like this, we're in danger either way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">To be honest, I'm not ready yet.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or rather, even being told the core is about to appear, it doesn't feel real.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe everyone else felt the same, because though no one agreed outright, no one tried to object either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> drew a long, slow breath.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="15">"Can you hear me? Your existence is already known. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">If this goes on, your existence will become public. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">If you have no objection, let us talk here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't quite shout, but she raised her voice toward the empty air.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And then―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Suddenly a wind raged across the spot.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\アポカリプティック大.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">At the same time, a roar loud enough to burst our eardrums rang out.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"What is this...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh...! Is this... the core showing up!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We covered our ears and crouched where we were.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">―How long had passed since the sound stopped?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, even after the sound stopped, we were </STYLE><STYLE ID="21" RUBY="おのの">trembling</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> and couldn't get a clear grasp of what was happening.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Only </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was looking around.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But from </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s expression, it seemed </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't understand what was happening either―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Ito</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, did it work?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"No..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So it's no good...? Not willing to negotiate, or...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="15">"It doesn't feel like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">It's as if my voice isn't being heard at all..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="17">"Hah hah hah! So you've finally noticed!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">A man's voice, heard out of nowhere.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Cage.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\栄一郎白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ白装束.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "100" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">"You're up to something pretty interesting. Think I'll watch from here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Heh-heh-heh. Long time no see, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">former Goddess</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The dead first generation, and second generation...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="15">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="15">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="17"> betrayed us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="15">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">'re nothing but an ordinary person now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">The Goddess couldn't possibly hear your voice, could she?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Still, we divine messengers came all the way out here like this, so we've been quite generous, haven't we?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ahaha, is the Goddess's wish finally going to come true?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\なつみ御使.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Next to appear, carrying a limp </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, was </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm sorry. I've been reborn, like this."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What are you talking about!? Snap out of it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> had this on her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If you use it, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you can be with us forever too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ngh...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">"Hey now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">, that'll just startle </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">, won't it? </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">This guy</STYLE><STYLE ID="17">'s the cautious type."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Now, now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="17">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> is a rookie divine messenger, after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Aww, too bad... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Then I'll stay out of the way and keep a close eye that nobody runs off."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was holding </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> with ease.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That alone meant this was not the physical strength of the </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> I knew.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Probably enough to wipe out those residents one-sidedly.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Which means we can no longer even escape.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">"Well, just so you know, </STYLE><STYLE ID="22">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="17"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="17"> are in the settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">We've got them tied up unharmed, as living witnesses for what comes next."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"It seems some other residents survived too, but this looks like more fun. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="23">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="24">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> have both died, fortunately."</STYLE><PG>
"Those two dying is fortunate...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="17">"Those two have blood flowing in them that threatens the Goddess. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">So their deaths were convenient. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="17">Now there's no threat to the Goddess anymore. Except for those of </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="17"> still living, that is."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"The rest depends on how the Goddess decides. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Your<STYLE ID="8"> negotiations: will she agree to them, or else... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Heh-heh-heh."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="17">"Okay, then let's get started right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
